            <div xml:id="d208">

                <pb facs="0238" n="226" sameAs="frus:frus1945v04/pg226"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">874.00/5–2645: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the United States
                        Representative in Bulgaria</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Barnes</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-05-26T12:00:00-04:00">May 26,
                            1945—noon</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>146. In order to forestall any eventual charge that we acted unilaterally in a
                    matter held to require joint action by the principal <pb facs="0239" n="227"
                        xml:id="pg227"/> Allies under the Yalta formula, you should request General
                    Crane to inform the ACC of Dimitrov’s arrival at your residence and your prompt
                    action in placing the matter before the Bulgarian authorities.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
